WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.122
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.626
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.697
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.301
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:43.343
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:54.117
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.558
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.996
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:07.067
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:14.735
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:42.566
Let go!

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.827
Let me go, you bastards!

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.032
That's enough already!

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.232
To hell with the Technos Taboo!

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:54.244
To the Steel Gorge

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:04.688
You little...

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:12.887
Okay, that'll do it.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.132
That was more troublesome than I expected.

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.430
Bogie, we're good. Let's go.

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:22.504
Iks hasn't come back yet.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:24.904
Huh? You mean he's not here?

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:28.442
He went out, saying he wanted
to enjoy the night breeze a little.

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.979
He didn't tell you on his way out?

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:45.291
Iks...

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:45.218
What Honoka sensed was
someone's bitterly cold soul.

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:48.856
Even sorrow was warmer than this.

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:53.291
What she found there was
a terribly hollow feeling.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.230
Pardon me.

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:01.774
It seems it came through to you as well.

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:03.569
Came through?

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.878
The thing that I felt.

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:07.778
What is it? What was that?

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:10.006
It's fine.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.508
It was nothing.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.014
Iks...

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:27.132
Iks?

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:28.729
Iks.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:30.567
Is something wrong?

00:04:30.837 --> 00:04:34.173
Oh, no, just letting you know
we're almost in Emporium.

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:35.003
That's all.

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:37.372
Oh, yes.

00:04:44.284 --> 00:04:45.512
Is it Iks?

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:46.747
Yeah.

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:49.619
This isn't like him.

00:04:51.724 --> 00:04:52.850
You're fine here?

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:55.928
I have not been in this area much, so...

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:57.096
You're going to wander around a bit?

00:04:57.096 --> 00:04:57.619
Yes.

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:02.035
Then, once I finish overhauling
this guy, I'll come back for you.

00:05:02.035 --> 00:05:03.229
Hang in there for a couple days.

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:09.997
See you later.

00:05:28.695 --> 00:05:31.289
One of your regulars is here, Joey!

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:32.922
Joey?

00:05:37.704 --> 00:05:40.104
Oh, Sword Dancer, I didn't know you were back.

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:40.968
Where's Joey?

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:44.203
So you haven't heard...

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:51.739
Hey, how about buying one of these?

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:54.210
This thing's incredible.

00:05:59.726 --> 00:06:00.727
Let's do this!

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:01.694
Right!

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:04.490
There!

00:06:04.997 --> 00:06:05.929
Hang in there!

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:07.291
Damn it!

00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:08.891
All right, mine survived!

00:06:09.168 --> 00:06:10.635
I'm so glad!

00:06:10.703 --> 00:06:12.637
Then, I guess it's my turn.

00:06:13.339 --> 00:06:14.397
Take that!

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:18.044
Awesome!

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:19.545
You can do stuff like that?!

00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:20.739
I've never seen that!

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:25.251
That was awesome! How do you do it?!

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:27.151
Nicely done, Joey.

00:06:29.589 --> 00:06:30.453
Miss...

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:33.992
Man, it's a little embarrassing.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.862
What did you do?

00:06:35.862 --> 00:06:37.557
Why did you infringe on the Technos Taboo?

00:06:37.764 --> 00:06:38.992
Aw, does it matter?

00:06:39.465 --> 00:06:41.592
Besides, I actually got off pretty light.

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:43.569
It's not exactly light, is it?

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:44.160
What?

00:06:44.537 --> 00:06:45.970
That's what I heard.

00:06:46.205 --> 00:06:47.840
That at the very least,

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.037
you won't be authorized
to work as a Technos here.

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:53.509
There're plenty of ways around that.

00:06:53.613 --> 00:06:54.914
Wandering across the desert,

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:57.508
making a life like the old man
did wouldn't be bad, either.

00:06:58.117 --> 00:07:00.853
It sounds cool when you put it that way,

00:07:00.853 --> 00:07:02.343
but you'd be an outsider.

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:06.056
If Zankan were alive, I'm sure
he would've been against it.

00:07:06.959 --> 00:07:08.461
Then what should I do?

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:09.018
What?

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:11.429
I realized something.

00:07:11.664 --> 00:07:12.995
With this incident.

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:15.134
As long as I keep working as a Technos,

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:17.637
I'll want to learn more and more new tech.

00:07:17.637 --> 00:07:19.264
I'll want more and more new mecha.

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:24.505
I was bound to butt heads with the
Technos Taboo sooner or later.

00:07:28.414 --> 00:07:30.609
Man, talk about noisy.

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:34.010
This place has been around
since I was a kid, you know?

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.622
Noisy and stinking of oil, it's a pit.

00:07:40.359 --> 00:07:43.920
But somehow, it looked like so much fun.

00:07:44.664 --> 00:07:47.963
That's why I wanted to get in this line of work.

00:07:48.568 --> 00:07:49.626
So...

00:07:51.737 --> 00:07:53.227
So, what?

00:07:53.539 --> 00:07:54.938
You know...

00:07:55.174 --> 00:07:56.436
What? I can't hear you.

00:07:56.909 --> 00:08:00.310
Screw you, Technos Taboo!

00:08:11.824 --> 00:08:14.793
Teacher, you're not drinking today?

00:08:14.861 --> 00:08:16.729
Unfortunately, I'm driving.

00:08:16.729 --> 00:08:19.892
Wow, I guess you do casually
worry about things like that.

00:08:20.032 --> 00:08:21.534
Casually, nothing.

00:08:21.534 --> 00:08:23.695
I'm technically a teacher, you know.

00:08:23.903 --> 00:08:25.564
Oh, please, Teacher!

00:08:26.472 --> 00:08:29.202
Honestly. Kids these days...

00:08:45.157 --> 00:08:47.387
Where do you think you're going? And all alone.

00:08:48.194 --> 00:08:49.126
Teacher...

00:08:49.495 --> 00:08:51.588
There's nothing but desert that way.

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:54.166
If you're going back to town, you want a ride?

00:08:54.433 --> 00:08:56.560
Thank you very much, but...

00:08:57.036 --> 00:08:59.470
You're acting sort of different than usual.

00:08:59.605 --> 00:09:00.867
That's not true.

00:09:01.474 --> 00:09:04.068
You've got this look on your face
like you're hiding something.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.605
You're honest, so it shows on your face.

00:09:07.313 --> 00:09:10.771
The mystery of it is that even then,
you're still hard to read.

00:09:12.485 --> 00:09:14.854
I've thought this for some time,

00:09:14.854 --> 00:09:18.950
but you always seem like you're
evading what's important.

00:09:19.258 --> 00:09:21.749
Tell me, where're you trying to go?

00:09:22.028 --> 00:09:24.053
Show a little honesty and tell me where.

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:26.759
I didn't really mean to hide it...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.190
The Steel Gorge.

00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:30.736
The Steel Gorge?

00:09:30.736 --> 00:09:33.139
What? The Steel Gorge?!

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:36.336
Isn't that an area that infringes
on the Technos Taboo?!

00:09:37.009 --> 00:09:38.704
And a Class 1 infringement at that...

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:40.805
That's what I've heard as well.

00:09:41.113 --> 00:09:43.343
How can you be so calm, telling me that?

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:46.043
You think The Third will just
sit back and watch you do this?

00:09:46.786 --> 00:09:49.653
I must go.

00:09:51.857 --> 00:09:53.017
Did you tell Hono?

00:09:55.261 --> 00:09:57.563
Well, I guess you couldn't.

00:09:57.563 --> 00:09:59.198
To her...

00:09:59.198 --> 00:10:01.758
To Miss Honoka, I would
like you not to mention this.

00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:03.830
I don't want to drag her into this.

00:10:04.036 --> 00:10:06.339
Are you planning on not coming back?

00:10:06.339 --> 00:10:07.601
That...

00:10:08.341 --> 00:10:11.174
...is not something that
will be determined by me.

00:10:11.677 --> 00:10:13.269
Looks like there's no use stopping you.

00:10:15.014 --> 00:10:16.248
But there is that.

00:10:16.248 --> 00:10:19.274
Without you around,
I'll get to monopolize Hono.

00:10:20.086 --> 00:10:22.418
I have no intention of allowing
that to happen on my watch.

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:23.479
What?

00:10:23.923 --> 00:10:25.720
Those are fighting words!

00:10:26.058 --> 00:10:28.185
I never thought you'd say such a thing.

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:30.888
With the passage of days and months,
even I will change.

00:10:31.697 --> 00:10:33.899
It goes to show just how
long it's been for me.

00:10:33.899 --> 00:10:36.891
Upon this beautiful planet
and among its people...

00:10:46.612 --> 00:10:47.544
Honoka.

00:10:48.447 --> 00:10:50.074
What are you thinking?

00:10:50.916 --> 00:10:52.406
Nothing.

00:10:53.519 --> 00:10:55.646
I'm just looking at the stars.

00:10:59.458 --> 00:11:01.323
It's nothing.

00:11:16.042 --> 00:11:17.976
Will it be a long trip?

00:11:18.077 --> 00:11:20.846
Well, it might turn out to be.

00:11:20.846 --> 00:11:22.711
But it probably won't be that bad.

00:11:23.382 --> 00:11:24.246
Hono?

00:11:25.151 --> 00:11:26.952
Is it actually a dangerous trip?

00:11:26.952 --> 00:11:28.920
What? It's not like that.

00:11:29.255 --> 00:11:33.259
Because you've never come to
tell me before you left on a trip.

00:11:33.259 --> 00:11:35.861
No, well, so...

00:11:35.861 --> 00:11:37.089
It's okay.

00:11:37.663 --> 00:11:39.528
I'm not worried.

00:11:39.999 --> 00:11:43.833
Since it's you, I have faith that you'll be all right.

00:11:44.203 --> 00:11:45.227
Millie...

00:11:46.005 --> 00:11:50.376
Besides, just like when we saw the
moonlight dragonflies together,

00:11:50.376 --> 00:11:54.005
I'm always with you, you know.

00:11:54.246 --> 00:11:58.046
I'll always be watching over you in my heart.

00:11:58.384 --> 00:12:00.579
Just like how you did for me.

00:12:00.686 --> 00:12:02.244
So I'm not worried.

00:12:03.122 --> 00:12:04.020
Millie...

00:12:05.758 --> 00:12:06.816
Thank you.

00:12:08.627 --> 00:12:11.494
Sounds like it's going to be
a dicey job, this next one.

00:12:11.931 --> 00:12:14.100
I guess nothing escapes you, either.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:17.136
If you don't mind telling me,
what kind of job is it?

00:12:17.136 --> 00:12:19.661
It's... not a job.

00:12:20.606 --> 00:12:22.506
It's just a little something I want to do.

00:12:22.942 --> 00:12:24.239
Something you want to do?

00:12:24.643 --> 00:12:27.203
I'm thinking of going to the Steel Gorge.

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:31.208
An intruder?

00:12:31.617 --> 00:12:33.244
It is not certain yet.

00:12:33.753 --> 00:12:36.021
But while there is still quite a distance to go,

00:12:36.021 --> 00:12:38.615
the path is headed straight for the Steel Gorge.

00:12:40.726 --> 00:12:43.559
You're planning to pick a fight with The Third?

00:12:43.729 --> 00:12:46.664
If they're going to take offense,
it'll probably end up that way.

00:12:47.133 --> 00:12:49.602
I just don't understand
why they need it anymore.

00:12:49.602 --> 00:12:51.370
This Technos Taboo thing...

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.496
Why go to such lengths?

00:12:53.405 --> 00:12:55.474
The Joey kid that I just told you about...

00:12:55.474 --> 00:12:57.999
Do you know why he broke the Technos Taboo?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.847
It was to improve my tank's performance.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.519
I don't really understand the specifics,

00:13:06.519 --> 00:13:10.055
but he said he needed some
cutting-edge parts that would improve...

00:13:10.055 --> 00:13:12.523
...the control response
between Bogie and the machine.

00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:14.160
And that's why...

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.424
He got caught violating the Technos Taboo.

00:13:16.862 --> 00:13:19.660
I finally found out by
asking some other Technos.

00:13:20.065 --> 00:13:23.262
Joey didn't mention a word about it.

00:13:23.869 --> 00:13:25.029
So I...

00:13:25.671 --> 00:13:27.764
You feel you're responsible?

00:13:28.374 --> 00:13:30.069
That isn't what this is about.

00:13:30.276 --> 00:13:33.006
I just can't believe it's good
for things to stay this way.

00:13:36.248 --> 00:13:37.738
I'm going to head out.

00:13:40.085 --> 00:13:41.609
Thank you for everything.

00:13:43.255 --> 00:13:43.949
Hono...

00:13:44.456 --> 00:13:45.218
What?

00:13:46.025 --> 00:13:48.994
Do you know where Iks is?

00:13:49.128 --> 00:13:50.959
Iks? Why?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:54.788
He's headed for the Steel Gorge on his own, too.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.769
I don't know what his objective is,

00:13:56.769 --> 00:13:58.464
but he seemed a little different than usual.

00:13:59.772 --> 00:14:00.568
No way...

00:14:01.473 --> 00:14:02.963
You'd better go after him.

00:14:03.776 --> 00:14:05.444
If you want to see him...

00:14:05.444 --> 00:14:07.309
If you don't want this to be goodbye.

00:14:20.459 --> 00:14:22.393
I'm such an idiot, too.

00:14:23.128 --> 00:14:27.827
It's like I just told my husband
where to find his mistress.

00:14:29.635 --> 00:14:31.937
On the path leading to the Steel Gorge,

00:14:31.937 --> 00:14:34.997
Iks was making his way forward,
step by steady step,

00:14:36.308 --> 00:14:39.612
as if reassuring himself of the
land and life on this planet,

00:14:39.612 --> 00:14:41.477
and showing his fondness for it.

00:15:18.517 --> 00:15:19.745
Stop right there.

00:15:19.985 --> 00:15:21.213
Where are you headed?

00:15:21.687 --> 00:15:22.881
The Steel Gorge.

00:15:25.157 --> 00:15:26.886
That area is off limits.

00:15:27.159 --> 00:15:28.592
Turn back immediately.

00:15:29.261 --> 00:15:30.819
I cannot do that.

00:15:31.063 --> 00:15:33.725
I have a need to go there.

00:15:35.334 --> 00:15:37.063
Stop! Stop now!

00:15:37.503 --> 00:15:38.128
We will open fire!

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.402
Stop!

00:15:43.509 --> 00:15:45.210
That is all,

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.612
but Joganki,

00:15:46.612 --> 00:15:49.949
we have just received footage
from the autonomous soldiers.

00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:51.143
You will view it, I trust?

00:15:51.517 --> 00:15:54.353
You'll make me, even if I say
I don't want to, correct?

00:15:54.353 --> 00:15:55.980
Then, I will do just that.

00:15:56.789 --> 00:15:59.383
It'll be displayed so you can see
with your eyes or your astral eye.

00:16:05.431 --> 00:16:08.127
Enough. There's no mistake. It's him.

00:16:09.835 --> 00:16:12.104
Needless to say, the Steel Gorge...

00:16:12.104 --> 00:16:16.097
...is the most critical restricted
area under the Technos Taboo.

00:16:16.709 --> 00:16:20.543
And at the same time, it is a place
with extremely crucial significance.

00:16:21.447 --> 00:16:24.041
It's an area that is directly
under your jurisdiction.

00:16:24.416 --> 00:16:26.577
Please address this matter immediately.

00:16:33.959 --> 00:16:34.891
Iks!

00:16:35.494 --> 00:16:36.483
Miss Honoka...

00:16:36.795 --> 00:16:39.059
Why? Why didn't you say anything?!

00:16:41.567 --> 00:16:43.869
Our contract hasn't ended yet!

00:16:43.869 --> 00:16:47.737
I thought you needed me when
you went out into the desert!

00:16:48.407 --> 00:16:53.037
What is to come is something I must do alone.

00:16:53.312 --> 00:16:54.506
No matter what?

00:16:56.515 --> 00:16:58.710
I can't come with you?

00:17:03.889 --> 00:17:05.322
Iks...

00:17:11.497 --> 00:17:14.800
Is this something you have
to think about, Honoka?

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:15.892
Bogie...

00:17:16.502 --> 00:17:19.130
All you have to do is yell out how you really feel.

00:17:19.605 --> 00:17:21.630
What are you doing waiting for
a machine to tell you that?

00:17:22.941 --> 00:17:24.203
Honoka!

00:17:31.683 --> 00:17:33.207
Don't go, Iks!

00:17:38.424 --> 00:17:41.621
You told me, remember? That you
want to see this world with me?

00:17:42.227 --> 00:17:45.697
I want to see it, too! The world that you know!

00:17:45.697 --> 00:17:46.629
Miss Honoka...

00:17:46.832 --> 00:17:50.436
We've been together all this time,
and I don't know anything about you!

00:17:50.436 --> 00:17:53.633
Do you understand that?!
I wanted to ask, but I was holding back!

00:17:54.306 --> 00:17:57.342
Because it felt like it would all be over if I asked.

00:17:57.342 --> 00:17:59.833
Because it felt like you might go far away!

00:18:00.646 --> 00:18:02.714
Don't go without saying anything!

00:18:02.714 --> 00:18:05.877
Not when I haven't asked you anything at all...

00:18:06.452 --> 00:18:09.717
Not when I don't know
anything at all about you...

00:18:10.155 --> 00:18:12.385
That's not fair.

00:18:21.834 --> 00:18:23.131
Pardon me.

00:18:23.502 --> 00:18:25.129
For only ever hiding things from you.

00:18:26.305 --> 00:18:28.540
It seems I allowed myself to be spoiled...

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.135
...by your kindness in not
trying to ask anything of me.

00:18:36.248 --> 00:18:39.649
Let us go together. Please come to know me.

00:18:41.386 --> 00:18:42.444
Iks!

00:19:05.911 --> 00:19:07.276
It's cold.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:10.082
Is the universe this cold?

00:19:10.082 --> 00:19:11.140
Yes.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:14.253
That's precisely why the birth of planets...

00:19:14.253 --> 00:19:17.450
...and the birth of life was
such a significant event.

00:19:17.723 --> 00:19:20.590
Because those things eased this coldness.

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:24.293
Because life is warm?

00:19:25.063 --> 00:19:29.159
At times, this warm life vanishes senselessly.

00:19:30.369 --> 00:19:33.065
In numerous conflicts and bloodshed.

00:19:40.679 --> 00:19:45.116
At times like that, unbeknownst to
anyone, the planet sheds tears.

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:49.254
Feeling that if this is what life brings,
it would have been better...

00:19:49.254 --> 00:19:52.121
...to remain solitary,
floating in the cold universe.

00:19:52.724 --> 00:19:54.385
A planet's tears...

00:20:06.405 --> 00:20:09.033
Did you feel it? The soul of the planet...

00:20:09.107 --> 00:20:09.903
Yeah.

00:20:10.375 --> 00:20:14.746
I feel like I've felt that same
sort of sorrow before.

00:20:14.746 --> 00:20:18.876
Not exactly sorrow, but more
hollow and bitterly cold...

00:20:19.384 --> 00:20:20.681
I know.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.189
For I was feeling it at the same time.

00:20:24.189 --> 00:20:24.883
That time...

00:20:29.194 --> 00:20:31.162
I wanted you to know.

00:20:31.597 --> 00:20:33.365
Through the planet's soul,

00:20:33.365 --> 00:20:36.163
what lies at the bottom of that bitterly cold soul.

00:20:36.602 --> 00:20:38.593
Who's soul was that?

00:20:39.404 --> 00:20:41.506
It's to meet that soul...

00:20:41.506 --> 00:20:43.974
...that I have set my course for the Steel Gorge.

00:20:56.054 --> 00:21:01.014
You certainly readied an inordinate
amount of armament, Fila Marique.

00:21:01.393 --> 00:21:03.987
Best to be fully prepared.

00:21:04.229 --> 00:21:05.931
How truly reassuring.

00:21:05.931 --> 00:21:09.234
And to think you would accompany
me yourself on top of that.

00:21:09.234 --> 00:21:12.203
If you wish, please feel free
to voice your sarcasm.

00:21:12.838 --> 00:21:15.107
But with this situation before us,

00:21:15.107 --> 00:21:17.476
I cannot watch from the sidelines, either.

00:21:17.476 --> 00:21:18.744
I will say this now,

00:21:18.744 --> 00:21:21.647
but in the unlikely event that
we have to fight against him,

00:21:21.647 --> 00:21:25.208
even a hundred times the force
we have may prove pointless.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:31.448
It seems he is not our only opponent.

00:21:32.024 --> 00:21:33.753
Another person has joined him.

00:21:34.259 --> 00:21:36.693
That girl that you know so well.

00:21:38.797 --> 00:21:39.855
Honoka!

00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:56.581
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.581 --> 00:22:00.652
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.652 --> 00:22:03.188
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.188 --> 00:22:06.214
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.858 --> 00:22:10.329
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.329 --> 00:22:14.333
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:16.902
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.902 --> 00:22:20.065
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:20.138 --> 00:22:23.608
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.608 --> 00:22:27.012
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:27.012 --> 00:22:30.482
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.482 --> 00:22:34.111
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.787 --> 00:22:42.561
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.561 --> 00:22:49.262
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.501 --> 00:22:56.341
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.341 --> 00:23:01.176
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.148 --> 00:23:08.745
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.889
Preview

00:23:17.129 --> 00:23:20.532
Awaiting Iks and I as we made our
way towards the Steel Gorge...

00:23:20.532 --> 00:23:24.770
...was a massive army of
autonomous soldiers led by Joganki...

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:26.863
...that blanketed the entire desert.

00:23:27.305 --> 00:23:30.206
But I forged on ahead.

00:23:30.675 --> 00:23:35.078
To meet that which was ahead of us.

00:23:36.281 --> 00:23:40.051
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.051 --> 00:23:42.053
final episode, "The Story That Begins Here".

00:23:42.053 --> 00:23:43.288
The Story That Begins Here
final episode, "The Story That Begins Here".

00:23:43.288 --> 00:23:44.915
The Story That Begins Here
